gametitle=Killzone (SCUS-97402) - KillzoneRecomp reference-run input hook (temporary)
// scePadRead call at 0x416d98 goes through a cave at 0xFF000 that clears the buttons in the word at 0xFFF00
// (active-high mask, written over PINE) from the pad reply, and sets the cross pressure byte when cross is in it.
